WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.534 --> 00:00:02.667
-Guys, finally, it is Tuesday.
it is time for "WeTweet"!

00:00:02.667 --> 00:00:03.667
Here we go.

00:00:03.667 --> 00:00:06.701
-♪ WeTweet ♪

00:00:08.334 --> 00:00:10.200
♪ WeTweet ♪

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:11.567
-Welcome to "WeTweet."

00:00:11.567 --> 00:00:13.934
This is where we, as a group,

00:00:13.934 --> 00:00:16.501
decide something that we should
post on Twitter.

00:00:16.501 --> 00:00:18.300
I'm going to show you
five different tweets.

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:19.734
We're all going to vote on

00:00:19.734 --> 00:00:20.901
whether you like
each one or not.

00:00:20.901 --> 00:00:22.667
You all have voting clickers
at your seats.

00:00:22.667 --> 00:00:24.033
You see them there.

00:00:24.033 --> 00:00:25.501
You can vote for all of them,
if you like.

00:00:25.501 --> 00:00:27.701
You can vote for none of them.
Whatever you want.

00:00:27.701 --> 00:00:29.100
We're going to see
the results live.

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:30.334
Higgins, Roots,
you have clickers?

00:00:30.334 --> 00:00:32.167
-Got it.
-Alright. Very good.

00:00:32.167 --> 00:00:35.367
Whichever gets the most likes,
we're gonna tweet it out,

00:00:35.367 --> 00:00:38.133
so you can all like it
and wetweet it.

00:00:38.133 --> 00:00:40.133
[ Laughs ]
It's a shared experience.

00:00:40.133 --> 00:00:41.434
Alright, guys,
you ready for this?

00:00:41.434 --> 00:00:45.367
-[ Cheers ]
-Alright.

00:00:45.367 --> 00:00:47.067
And be kind. It's the holidays.

00:00:47.067 --> 00:00:49.334
Okay, here we go.
The first tweet is...

00:00:54.501 --> 00:00:57.200
-Wow.
-Yeah, just dead silence.

00:00:57.200 --> 00:00:59.133
[ Laughter ]

00:00:59.133 --> 00:01:01.767
Not even a titter.
-Not even a titter.

00:01:01.767 --> 00:01:04.434
-Not even a titter for Twitter.
-Not even a golf applause.

00:01:04.434 --> 00:01:05.767
-Nothing on that one. Alright.

00:01:05.767 --> 00:01:07.767
I think the votes are
probably in on this one.

00:01:07.767 --> 00:01:10.133
Let's see the results.

00:01:10.133 --> 00:01:11.133
Yeah.
-Whoa!

00:01:11.133 --> 00:01:12.801
[ Sad tuba ]

00:01:12.801 --> 00:01:16.000
Wow! 132.

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:17.834
-Not everyone even voted on
that.

00:01:17.834 --> 00:01:20.434
-No. They said, "We're good.
No thanks."

00:01:20.434 --> 00:01:22.234
-"Jimmy, we're here for
the commercial breaks."

00:01:22.234 --> 00:01:23.734
[ Laughter ]

00:01:23.734 --> 00:01:26.501
-Want more Terry's Steaks.
-This next one says...

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:32.400
[ Laughter ]

00:01:34.767 --> 00:01:36.901
It's all -- Every page.

00:01:36.901 --> 00:01:39.467
Some weird -- Yeah.
-Neon blue.

00:01:39.467 --> 00:01:41.434
-Smurf.
-Windex.

00:01:41.434 --> 00:01:43.467
-Yeah, Windex.
Smurf, whatever they want.

00:01:43.467 --> 00:01:44.534
Yeah, here we go.

00:01:44.534 --> 00:01:45.734
Let's see the results
on this one.

00:01:45.734 --> 00:01:47.100
I think this one
will fare better.

00:01:47.100 --> 00:01:48.133
Alright. Not bad.

00:01:48.133 --> 00:01:50.300
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:51.167 --> 00:01:52.334
-112.
-Yeah.

00:01:52.334 --> 00:01:53.734
-Tough crowd. Very honest.

00:01:53.734 --> 00:01:55.667
Very honest.

00:01:55.667 --> 00:01:58.133
It doesn't really matter,
I should also let you know.

00:01:58.133 --> 00:01:59.400
[ Laughter ]

00:01:59.400 --> 00:02:00.634
This next one here says...

00:02:03.434 --> 00:02:05.033
[ Laughter ]

00:02:05.033 --> 00:02:07.300
-Come on.
-I don't want to go there.

00:02:07.300 --> 00:02:09.467
It's too much work.

00:02:09.467 --> 00:02:11.934
-How is Jim?
-Oh, he's doing well.

00:02:13.501 --> 00:02:14.934
Let's see the results here.

00:02:15.868 --> 00:02:17.434
-Whoa!

00:02:17.434 --> 00:02:19.400
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:19.400 --> 00:02:20.601
-I knew that.

00:02:20.601 --> 00:02:22.968
I appreciate that.
So they do work.

00:02:22.968 --> 00:02:25.701
The clickers do work.
Alright, that's real.

00:02:25.701 --> 00:02:27.634
I love this. Alright. Fun.
This is good.

00:02:27.634 --> 00:02:29.634
That might be --
-That might be the winner, 171.

00:02:29.634 --> 00:02:30.968
-I think it definitely is
going to be the winner.

00:02:30.968 --> 00:02:32.567
Alright, let's see.
The next one says...

00:02:36.200 --> 00:02:37.968
[ Laughter ]

00:02:37.968 --> 00:02:40.234
Would you like a black one?
-Please.

00:02:40.234 --> 00:02:42.467
Do you have a blue one?
-We don't have black markers.

00:02:42.467 --> 00:02:44.300
-What do you have?
-We have blue.

00:02:44.300 --> 00:02:46.667
-I'm good.
-Okay.

00:02:46.667 --> 00:02:48.300
Let's see the results
on this one.

00:02:49.701 --> 00:02:51.133
Yeah. Wow.

00:02:51.133 --> 00:02:52.734
[ Crowd booing ]

00:02:52.734 --> 00:02:55.067
-[ Sad tuba ]
-No, you can't boo. No, stop.

00:02:55.067 --> 00:02:58.367
Don't play that. Don't boo.
They're all fun.

00:02:58.367 --> 00:03:01.300
-Well, that tweet was
the Pepsi of this round.

00:03:01.300 --> 00:03:03.000
-Yeah.

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:04.467
-Wow!

00:03:04.467 --> 00:03:05.801
-Alright. This last one says...

00:03:09.434 --> 00:03:11.033
[ Laughter ]

00:03:13.501 --> 00:03:14.634
-Oh, wow!

00:03:14.634 --> 00:03:16.601
-This is just
my favorite sweater.

00:03:16.601 --> 00:03:18.367
How dare you?

00:03:18.367 --> 00:03:21.067
Alright, here we go.
Let's see the results.

00:03:22.467 --> 00:03:24.834
-Oh!
-That's the winner right there,
everybody.

00:03:24.834 --> 00:03:27.667
By one vote.
Ugly Christmas sweater.

00:03:27.667 --> 00:03:29.367
I'm going to post this
during the commercial break.

00:03:29.367 --> 00:03:31.200
If you see it on your feed,
give it a like,

00:03:31.200 --> 00:03:32.634
